                <pb facs="0560" n="444" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg444"/>

                <head>Wireless telegraph convention between the United States and other
                    Powers</head>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Berlin, November 3, 1906; ratification advised
                        by the Senate, April 3, 1912; ratified by the President, April 22, 1912;
                        ratification of the United States deposited with the Government of Germany,
                        May 17, 1912; proclaimed, May 25, 1912.</hi>
                </p>

